  <reporting-org ref="BD-NAB-002" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRAC</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equitable and Sustainable WASH Services in Bangladesh Delta plan Hotspots 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Develop and implement a contextualised microcredit model for safely managed water and sanitation (basic minimum ) services to adapt to extreme climate events in Climate hotspots
2.	Strengthen WASH supply chains and develop an entrepreneur-based operation &amp; maintenance model for drinking water and sanitation services in Climate hotspots engaging entrepreneurs (and technologies); working in similar context to introduce and market appropriate drinking water treatment technologies
3.	Support local government institutions to roll out the WASH pro-poor strategy and to strengthen the local subsidy mechanisms for those without access to safe water and sanitation (selected Union Parishads)</narrative>
  </description>
